        "label": "Why Bamboo?",
        "heading": "Nature's Perfect Frame Material",
        "text": "<p>Bamboo combines the best qualities of steel, carbon, and titanium. It's stronger than steel, absorbs vibration better than carbon fibre, and grows back in just 3-5 years.<\/p>",
